Redesign the Case Study metadata block. By default it now spans the full width of its container, opening with the screenshot and laying the other details out as information boxes in centred rows of up to four. A new `Layout` option keeps the previous narrow aside, floated to the right of the text, as `Compact`. The organization and provider information blocks now share the same `InfoBox` base, and every box carries a class named after its content, such as `versions` or `usages`. @ericof
